nt de vous rendre en gare, v&#233;rifiez vos horaires sur l&#8217;appli Ile-de-France Mobilit&#233;s, le site Transilien.com, SNCF Connect ou votre appli de mobilit&#233;. <br><br>Motif : difficult&#233;s li&#233;es &#224; une indisponibilit&#233; du mat&#233;riel.<\/p>","shortMessage":"Trafic fortement perturbé","impactedSections":[{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01729","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:68407","name":"Chelles - Gournay (Chelles)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:488087","name":"Nanterre-La-Folie (Nanterre)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01729","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:488087","name":"Nanterre-La-Folie (Nanterre)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:68407","name":"Chelles - Gournay (Chelles)"}}],"disruption_id":"dfc41b09-d8a4-4a25-8877-85fdb3c99c36"},{"id":"b1824243-4a36-4754-a211-4cabd3ecbe77","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260901T070946","end":"20260901T073402"}],"lastUpdate":"20260901T071410","cause":"PERTURBATION","severity":"PERTURBEE","tags":["Actualité"],"title":"Métro 13 : Ajustement de l'intervalle entre les trains - Train stationne","message":"<p>Un train stationne à Porte de Saint-Ouen vers Châtillon - Montrouge en raison d'un ajustement de l'intervalle entre les trains  .<\/p>","shortMessage":"Train stationne","disruption_id":"b8a96aa2-fd31-4e88-8a55-591a222a773c"},{"id":"f8982146-e76c-4a2f-91b3-96b8b92899e9","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260901T074015","end":"20260901T074115"}],"lastUpdate":"20260901T074411","cause":"PERTURBATION","severity":"PERTURBEE","tags":["Actualité"],"title":"Métro 13 : Incident (intervention conducteur) - Trains stationnent","message":"<p>Des trains stationnent entre Saint-Denis - Porte de Paris et Carrefour Pleyel vers Châtillon - Montrouge en raison d'un incident nécessitant l’intervention du conducteur à Carrefour Pleyel .<\/p>","shortMessage":"Trains stationnent","impactedSections":[{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01383","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:ID